London\"}],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"HO00007533\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Avatar: Fire and Ash\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Jake and Neytiri's family grapples with grief after Neteyam's death, encountering a new, aggressive Na'vi tribe, the Ash People, who are led by the fiery Varang, as the conflict on Pandora escalates and a new moral focus emerges.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Jake and Neytiri's family grapples with grief after Neteyam's death, encountering a new, aggressive Na'vi tribe, the Ash People, who are led by the fiery Varang.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000001\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-12-19\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":197,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":8,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000560\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002207\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002294\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005786\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005787\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007837\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"17711\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"17712\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"17713\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000042\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000349\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000696\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00002427\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000001\",\"0000000010\",\"0000000011\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"a4cb369f-77c4-4fe1-8f85-dd5e76b195dd\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00007533\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008563\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"WALT DISNEY STUDIOS INTERNTL\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008012\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"The Housemaid\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"THE HOUSEMAID is a wildly entertaining thriller starring Sydney Sweeney and Amanda Seyfried, based on the best-selling book. From director Paul Feig, the film plunges audiences into a twisted world where perfection is an illusion, and nothing is as it seems. Trying to escape her past, Millie (Sweeney) accepts a job as a live-in housemaid for the wealthy Nina (Seyfried) and Andrew Winchester (Brandon Sklenar). But what begins as a dream job quickly unravels into something far more dangerous — a sexy, seductive game of secrets, scandal, and power. Behind the Winchesters’ closed doors lies a world of shocking twists that will leave you guessing until the very end.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"THE HOUSEMAID is a wildly entertaining thriller starring Sydney Sweeney and Amanda Seyfried, based on the best-selling book. \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong violence, injury detail, sex, sexual violence, very strong language\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-12-22\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":131,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kdDdlY2VPxw\",\"displayPriority\":2,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009161\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012707\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016976\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016977\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000031\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000135\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000814\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001305\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000020\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"dc7be94d-5ba5-4a79-accd-48ed4d19a3b6\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008012\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009092\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"LIONSGATE INTERNATIONAL\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008080\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Hamnet\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"From Academy Award® winning writer/director Chloé Zhao, HAMNET tells the powerful love story that inspired the creation of Shakespeare’s timeless masterpiece, Hamlet.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"From Academy Award® winning writer/director Chloé Zhao, HAMNET tells the powerful love story that inspired the creation of Shakespeare’s timeless masterpiece, Hamlet.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000001\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"distressing scenes, brief moderate sex\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-09\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":126,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":1,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003903\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007355\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011027\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017134\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000116\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000321\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000322\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000355\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001794\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001974\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000005\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"37b2b94f-65a0-481e-9d3c-bde2445c99a4\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008080\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009165\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"UNIVERSAL PICTURES\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008101\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Marty Supreme\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Marty Mauser, a young man with a dream no one respects, goes to hell and back in pursuit of greatness.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Marty Mauser, a young man with a dream no one respects, goes to hell and back in pursuit of greatness.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong language, sex, nudity, injury detail, violence\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-12-26\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":150,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=s9gSuKaKcqM\",\"displayPriority\":7,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001370\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012950\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014188\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014753\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017170\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017171\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"17172\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"17173\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"17174\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"2227\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000258\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001800\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000009\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"90e71dd1-a916-4807-8aff-0dd9f141e72d\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008101\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009187\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"ENTERTAINMENT FILM DISTRIBUTOR\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008189\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"28 Years Later: The Bone Temple\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Expanding upon the world created by Danny Boyle and Alex Garland in 28 Years Later - but turning that world on its head - Nia DaCosta directs 28 Years Later: The Bone Temple. In a continuation of the epic story, Dr. Kelson (Ralph Fiennes) finds himself in a shocking new relationship - with consequences that could change the world as they know it - and Spike's (Alfie Williams) encounter with Jimmy Crystal (Jack O'Connell) becomes a nightmare he can't escape. In the world of The Bone Temple, the infected are no longer the greatest threat to survival - the inhumanity of the survivors can be stranger and more terrifying.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Expanding upon the world created by Danny Boyle and Alex Garland in 28 Years Later - but turning that world on its head - Nia DaCosta directs 28 Years Later.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000005\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong gory violence, injury detail, very strong language\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-14\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":109,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wyYliP8dPWU\",\"displayPriority\":9,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000097\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000442\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002404\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002653\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005575\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014011\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014576\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014577\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017355\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017356\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000576\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000014\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"12790418-6492-492a-814c-53673bc1ab1a\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008189\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009281\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"SONY PICTURES\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008191\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Rental Family\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"A down-and-out actor living in Tokyo is hired as a token American guy for a Japanese rental-family company, leading him on an unexpected journey of self-discovery through the roles he plays in other people’s lives.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"A down-and-out actor living in Tokyo is hired as a token American guy for a Japanese rental-family company, leading him on an unexpected journey of self-discovery.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000001\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"infrequent strong language, moderate sex references\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-16\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":110,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sZT37sM2VgE\",\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007702\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008791\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008792\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017357\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017358\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017359\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017360\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017361\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"2617\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000006\",\"0000000009\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"a2ea80c3-a876-47ff-9c5c-0cddaeae7ddd\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008191\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009283\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"WALT DISNEY STUDIOS INTERNTL\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008193\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Mercy\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"In the near future, a detective (Chris Pratt) stands on trial accused of murdering his wife. He has 90 minutes to prove his innocence to the advanced A.I. Judge (Rebecca Ferguson) he once championed, before it determines his fate.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"In the near future, a detective (Chris Pratt) stands on trial accused of murdering his wife. He has 90 minutes to prove his innocence to the advanced A.I. Judge.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000001\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"moderate violence, threat, injury detail, drug misuse, strong language\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-23\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":100,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sN-C09dfczY\",\"displayPriority\":12,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003235\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009008\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017362\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017363\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017364\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000086\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000825\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000982\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001684\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00002432\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000022\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"eea3fe00-3e2b-4dcc-9150-aedd76790a42\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008193\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009285\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"SONY PICTURES\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008327\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"No Other Choice\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Man-su (Lee Byung Hun), a specialist in paper manufacturing with 25 years of experience, is so satisfied with life that he can truthfully tell himself, “I’ve got it all.” While happily passing his days with his wife Miri (Son Yejin), their two children and two dogs, Man-su is suddenly informed by his company that he has been fired.\\n“We’re sorry. We have no other choice.”\\nFeeling shocked as if his head had been cut off by an ax, Man-su vows to find himself a new job within the next three months for the sake of his family. Despite his firm resolve to turn his life around, Man-su spends over a year drifting from one job interview after another, and working at a retail store. He eventually finds himself in danger of losing the very house that he struggled so hard to buy.\\nDesperate, he visits Moon Paper out of the blue and tries to hand over his CV, but he just ends up getting humiliated by line manager Choi Sun-chul (Park Hee Soon). Man-su knows he is better qualified than anyone to work at Moon Paper, so he comes to a certain decision.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"After being unemployed for several years, a man devises a unique plan to secure a new job: eliminate his competition.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong language, violence, injury detail, sex references\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-23\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":139,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":13,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000010701\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016863\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017619\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017620\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017621\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017622\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000006\",\"0000000009\",\"0000000053\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"e660de4a-88af-472a-a1e1-57ffb9dcbb49\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008327\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009425\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"MUBI UK Ltd\"}],\"castAndCrew\":[{\"id\":\"0000000560\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Kate\",\"familyName\":\"Winslet\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000002207\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Stephen\",\"familyName\":\"Lang\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000002294\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Cliff\",\"familyName\":\"Curtis\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000005786\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Sam\",\"familyName\":\"Worthington\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000005787\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Oona\",\"familyName\":\"Chaplin\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000007837\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Jack\",\"familyName\":\"Champion