pected journey of self-discovery.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000001\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"infrequent strong language, moderate sex references\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-16\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":110,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sZT37sM2VgE\",\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007702\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008791\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008792\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017357\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017358\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017359\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017360\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017361\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"2617\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000006\",\"0000000009\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"a2ea80c3-a876-47ff-9c5c-0cddaeae7ddd\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008191\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009283\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"WALT DISNEY STUDIOS INTERNTL\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008193\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Mercy\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"In the near future, a detective (Chris Pratt) stands on trial accused of murdering his wife. He has 90 minutes to prove his innocence to the advanced A.I. Judge (Rebecca Ferguson) he once championed, before it determines his fate.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"In the near future, a detective (Chris Pratt) stands on trial accused of murdering his wife. He has 90 minutes to prove his innocence to the advanced A.I. Judge.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000001\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"moderate violence, threat, injury detail, drug misuse, strong language\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-23\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":10