he fox Nick Wilde, team up again to crack a new case, the most perilous and intricate of their careers.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Brave rabbit cop Judy Hopps and her friend, the fox Nick Wilde, team up again to crack a new case, the most perilous and intricate of their careers.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000009\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"mild threat, violence\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-11-28\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":108,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":6,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003440\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003441\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003443\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000006395\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008394\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000015583\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000015584\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000082\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000488\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00002397\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000004\",\"0000000006\",\"0000000010\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"87004e42-c4bd-4468-8b83-00f122c59dd9\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00007316\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008328\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"WALT DISNEY STUDIOS INTERNTL\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008012\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"The Housemaid\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"THE HOUSEMAID is a wildly entertaining thriller starring Sydney Sweeney and Amanda Seyfried, based on the best-selling book. From director Paul Feig, the film plunges audiences into a twisted world where perfection is an illusion, and nothing is as it seems. Trying to escape her past, Millie (Sweeney) accepts a job as a live-in housemaid for the wealthy Nina (Seyfried) and Andrew Winchester (Brandon Sklenar). But what begins as a dream job quickly unravels into something far more dangerous — a sexy, seductive game of secrets, scandal, and power. Behind the Winchesters’ closed doors lies a world of shocking twists that will leave you guessing until the very end.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"THE HOUSEMAID is a wildly entertaining thriller starring Sydney Sweeney and Amanda Seyfried, based on the best-selling book. \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong violence, injury detail, sex, sexual violence, very strong language\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-12-22\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":131,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kdDdlY2VPxw\",\"displayPriority\":2,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009161\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012707\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016976\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016977\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000031\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000135\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000814\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001305\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000020\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"dc7be94d-5ba5-4a79-accd-48ed4d19a3b6\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008012\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009092\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"LIONSGATE INTERNATIONAL\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008080\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Hamnet\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"From Academy Award® winning writer/director Chloé Zhao, HAMNET tells the powerful love story that inspired the creation of Shakespeare’s timeless masterpiece, Hamlet.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"From Academy Award® winning writer/director Chloé Zhao, HAMNET tells the powerful love story that